; Risk_Gold_100
; Gold (XAUUSD) M15 Order Blocks -> M1 CISD, trading ENABLED.
;
; Size comes from risk, not a fixed lot:
;   lots = equity * 1.00% / (stop points * value per point per lot)
; Aggressive. A ten-loss run costs about 10%. The longest run measured was 5.
;
; Detection settings are the risk-adjusted winner of 128 three-year backtests:
;   +809.57 USD, 92 trades, 43.5% correct, profit factor 2.11, recovery 5.85,
;   drawdown 138.38, longest losing run 5.
;
; Those figures were measured with FIXED 0.01 lots. Risk sizing compounds and
; scales with the stop, so the equity curve will not match them. Re-test with
; this preset loaded before trusting any number.
;
; It also lost money in the first of the three years.

InpSwingMinATR=0.5
InpBOSMode=0
InpBOSBufferATR=0.1
InpATRPeriod=14
InpDispATRMult=2.5
InpDispCandleATRMult=0.8
InpDispMinBodyPct=55.0
InpDispMinRelStrength=1.5
InpMaxOBToBOSBars=8
InpRejectLegViolation=false
InpSwingLength=5
InpEnableBull=true
InpEnableBear=true
InpExtendBars=20
InpMaxActivePerDir=10
InpMaxAgeBars=0
InpOverlapMode=1
InpOverlapPct=50.0
InpFVGMode=1
InpFVGMinATR=0.05
InpRetestEnabled=true
InpMitigationMode=2
InpInvalidationMode=1
InpScanDepth=3000
InpEnableCISD=true
InpCISDSweep=false
InpCISDConfirm=true
InpCISDRetrace=false
InpCISDSwingLength=3
InpCISDSwingMinATR=0.3
InpCISDSwingMaxAge=150
InpCISDSweepMode=0
InpCISDSweepValidity=10
InpCISDLevelMode=0
InpCISDMaxSeries=12
InpCISDMaxConfirmBars=20
InpCISDMaxRetraceBars=50
InpCISDScanDepth=1500
InpConnEnable=true
InpConnCISDMode=0
InpConnRetestMode=0
InpConnMaxCISDBars=100
InpConnWarmupBars=200
InpConnMaxRetests=10
InpConnMitigationStops=true
InpTrendFilter=true
InpTrendBars=20
InpTrendATRMult=2.5
InpEnableTrading=true
InpLots=0.01
InpMagic=20260928
InpSlippage=20
InpOppositeBlockExit=false
InpEntryAlert=true
InpTargetRR=2.0
InpBreakEven=true
InpBreakEvenPoints=4000
InpRunSelfTest=false
InpLogLevel=1
InpTimeframePair=2
InpRideTrend=false
InpRiskPercentMode=true
InpRiskPercent=1.00
InpConfidenceLog=true
InpCapitalGuards=false
